  "name": "MedSAM2",
  "alternateName": [
    "Segment Anything in 3D Medical Images and Videos"
  ],
  "description": "Extension of MedSAM to 3D volumetric medical imaging and video sequences, built on Meta's SAM2 architecture. Handles instance-level segmentation across CT/MRI volumes and temporal tracking of anatomical structures across clinical video frames (endoscopy, ultrasound). Supports automated annotation of lesions in CT scans and cross-frame tracking workflows. Successor to MedSAM for teams working with 3D or dynamic imaging data.",
  "url": "https://github.com/bowang-lab/MedSAM2",
